# Expanding AI Tool Access & Canvas Data

The user wants the AI to have full access to Canvas data (materials, announcements, etc.) and more CRUD operations. 

## Proposed Changes

### [AI Tools Component]

#### [MODIFY] [ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
- **Enhanced Tools**:
    - [search_announcements(...)](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#144-171): Now returns the full `message_html` (stripped of HTML tags for the LLM) to allow the AI to actually read the content of announcements.
